 and users are unable to sign in, create accounts, or load chats, including previous conversations.\nL155:     * cite17†Mayank Parmar L156:     * August 19, 2026\nL157:     * 08:20 PM\nL158:     * cite42†0 L159: \nL160:   * #### cite43†Give one prompt to 20+ AI models with ChatPlayground AI for $79 L161: \nL162: AI tools can be incredibly useful, but using several of them at once can turn into a tab-management exercise. ChatPlayground AI tackles that problem by putting multiple models in one workspace, so you can compare their responses without constantly switching platforms. The ChatPlayground AI Unlimited Plan is $79 (MSRP $619).\nL163:     * BleepingComputer Deals\nL164:     * August 19, 2026\nL165:     * 02:06 PM\nL166:     * cite44†0 L167: \nL168:   * #### cite45†Own a learning bundle that connects AI & Six Sigma for just $40 L169: \nL170: The 2026 Complete AIGPE AI Certification Bundle combines eight courses and 28 hours of training in AI, project management, and Lean Six Sigma. The complete bundle is just $39.99 instead of $119.92.\nL171: \nL172:     * BleepingComputer Deals\nL173:     * August 17, 2026\nL174:     * 07:07 AM\nL175:     * cite46†0 L176:   * 1\nL177:   * cite47†2 L178:   * cite48†3 L179:   * cite49†4 L180:   * cite50†5 L181:   *   *   Upcoming Webinar\nL182: \nL183: Popular Stories\nL184: \nL185:   * cite51†Microsoft releases emergency Windows updates to fix RDS failures L186:   * cite52†Microsoft: September updates cause RDS failures on Windows Server L187:   * cite53†Hackers exploit Tencent app flaw to deploy GrayRabbit malware L188: ##### Follow us:\nL189: \nL190: ##### Main Sections\nL191: \nL192:   * cite54†News L193:   * cite55†Webinars L194:   * cite56†VPN Buyer Guides L195:   * cite57†SysAdmin Software Guides L196:   * cite58†Downloads L197:   * cite59†Virus Removal Guides L198:   * cite60†Tutorials L199:   * cite61†Startup Database L200:   * cite62†Uninstall Database L20